OL,3,GNEWSAShipping disruption delays food
OL,4,Awaste collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FShipping disruption in the Gulf has
OL,7,Fdelayed the rollout of a new food waste
OL,8,Fcollection service in Lincolnshire, a
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.
OL,11,FThe scheme had been due to begin in
OL,12,FSeptember but has now been pushed back
OL,13,Fto 19 October.
OL,15,FBoston Borough Council said the
OL,16,Fdelivery of vehicle parts needed for
OL,17,Fits new recycling fleet had been "held
OL,18,Fup due to disruption in the Strait of
OL,19,FHormuz".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
