OL,3,GNEWSAShipping disruption delays food
OL,4,Awaste collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Callum Butler said
OL,7,Fpostponing the service would allow time
OL,8,Fto ensure the fleet and collection
OL,9,Farrangements were in place so it "can
OL,10,Fintroduce the service as smoothly as
OL,11,Fpossible".
